  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Bobby G. Stevenson is an American technology entrepreneur who co-founded Ciber, the computer consulting business. A former programmer analyst at IBM and LTV Steel, he led Ciber as chief executive for more than two decades. His ownership in the company created his fortune as it expanded through acquisitions and broader technical services.",
    "confidence": {
      "score": 93,
